{"id":"196449e4ff7c48d2","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-bernoulliproduct.md","title":"Finite product Bernoulli mass","display":"df-bernoulliproduct — Finite product Bernoulli mass","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-bernoulliproduct","aliases":["27-df-bernoulliproduct"],"display":"df-bernoulliproduct — Finite product Bernoulli mass","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbextension]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.3.1","source_statement":"Finite mass formulation of Theorem 13.8","source_printed_pages":"580","source_pdf_pages":"604","verification_status":"local-expansion-of-source-definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-bernoulliproduct"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-bernoulliproduct</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bernoulliproduct — Finite product Bernoulli mass"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"53f1b3025ce14af2\" href=\"?note=53f1b3025ce14af2\" title=\"27-df-pbextension\">27-df-pbextension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.3.1"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Finite mass formulation of Theorem 13.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"580"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"604"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-expansion-of-source-definition"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in U_n\">\\(p\\in U_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"53f1b3025ce14af2\" href=\"?note=53f1b3025ce14af2\" title=\"27-df-pbextension\">27-df-pbextension</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta_p:\\mathbb B^n\\to[0,1],\\qquad\\beta_p(a)\\coloneqq\\left(\\prod_{i\\in N:\\,a_i=1}p_i\\right)\\left(\\prod_{i\\in N:\\,a_i=0}(1-p_i)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta_p:\\mathbb B^n\\to[0,1],\\qquad\\beta_p(a)\\coloneqq\\left(\\prod_{i\\in N:\\,a_i=1}p_i\\right)\\left(\\prod_{i\\in N:\\,a_i=0}(1-p_i)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb R\\quad \\mathbb E_p[f]\\coloneqq\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\beta_p(a)f(a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb R\\quad \\mathbb E_p[f]\\coloneqq\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\beta_p(a)f(a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将 Theorem 13.8 的独立 Bernoulli 随机变量及期望展开成有限质量函数和有限和，无需调用外部概率原子。分别对0/1坐标取积，避免边界出现 0^0。总质量为1由下游定理证明，定义时没有预设待证结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbextension","status":"resolved","id":"53f1b3025ce14af2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbextension]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbextension","status":"resolved","id":"53f1b3025ce14af2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$p\\in U_n$（see [[27-df-pbextension]]），$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in U_n","display":false},{"tex":"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_p:\\mathbb B^n\\to[0,1],\\qquad\\beta_p(a)\\coloneqq\\left(\\prod_{i\\in N:\\,a_i=1}p_i\\right)\\left(\\prod_{i\\in N:\\,a_i=0}(1-p_i)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb R\\quad \\mathbb E_p[f]\\coloneqq\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\beta_p(a)f(a).","display":true}],"bytes":1406,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-157","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-bernoulliproduct|df-bernoulliproduct — Finite product Bernoulli mass]]"},{"id":"f22777763c64bcce","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$p\\in U_n$；$\\beta_p,\\mathbb E_p$（see [[27-df-bernoulliproduct]]），$\\mathrm{PolExt}$ 及有限插值式（see [[27-thm-pbmultilinearinterpolation]]），$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$。"},{"id":"c7ddd9dada5543af","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$\\mathrm{PolExt},\\mathrm{MultiAffine}_n$（see [[27-df-pbpolynomialextension]]），$\\beta_p$（see [[27-df-bernoulliproduct]]），规范多项式重构（see [[27-thm-pbpoly]]）。"},{"id":"7af3f1703af3792c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$m\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$；对每个 $k\\in[m]$，$A_k,B_k\\subseteq[n]$ 且 $A_k\\cap B_k=\\varnothing$。$C_k,f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B$ 由下式构造，假定 $\\forall k,l\\in[m]\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(k\\ne l\\Rightarrow C_k(a)C_l(a)=0)$。$p\\in U_n=[0,1]^n$，$\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\beta_p$ 与有限期望 $\\mathbb E_p$ 见 [[27-df-bernoulliproduct]]。$\\mathrm{Rel}_f:U_n\\to[0,1]$ 由下式定义，空积为 $1$。"}],"outgoing":["53f1b3025ce14af2"]}